        "title": "Race Quad Components",
        "excerpt":"The following sections outline the main components that are required to start with FPV  and to build your first drone. The list is not complete and some parts maybe outdated when you read this page. It may be even wiser to buy a single component that combines multiple parts listed below, depending on what you desire. However, this list should guide you what the important parts of a race quad are and what I would’ve liked to know when I started this hobby. The shop links show where you can get the individual parts and are most of the time affiliate links. When you buy the parts using this link it does not cost you more but you support me. I provide the links to  the original equipement manufacturer (OEM) where you can find datasheets and further informations such as installation guides. If you would like to learn more about the operation of each part and how they interact with each other read the next pages which cover the theory behind FPV. On the left you see the menu to this project.   Batteries/Charger                  EV-Peak CQ3 Multi Charger 4x 100W NiMH / LiPO with Built-in Balance and EV-Peak Cellmeter-7 Battery Capacity Checker                  Component       Description       Shops       OEM Link       Comment                       Charger       EV-Peak CQ3 Multi Charger 4x 100W NiMH / LiPO with Built-in Balance       getfpv       EV-Peak       See OEM link for the manual                 Battery Checker       EV-Peak Cellmeter-7 Battery Capacity Checker       getfpv, Banggood       EV-Peak                         Battery       Lumenier 1300mah 3S 60C Lipo Battery (XT60)       getfpv       OEM Link                   Flight Controller (FC) and Power Distribution Board (PDB)                  Flight Controller MATEKSYS-F722 STD and Power Distribution Board MATEKSYS FCHUB-6S                  Component       Description       Shops       OEM Link       Comment                       Flight Controller       MATEKSYS F722 STD STM32 Built in OSD BMP280 Barometer Blackbox       getfpv, Banggood       MATEKSYS       See OEM link for the datasheet                 PDB       MATEKSYS FCHUB-6S W/ CURRENT SENSOR 184A, BEC 5V &amp; 10V       getfpv, Banggood       MATEKSYS                   FPV-System (Goggles, Camera)                     FPV system: FatShark HDO, RunCam Swift 2 and [VTX](/projects/fpv/glossar/#vtx) [TBS](/projects/fpv/glossar/#tbs) Unify Pro HV.                  Component       Description       Shops       OEM Link       Comment                       FPV Bundle       Ultimate FPV Bundle - Fat Shark HDO, rapidFIRE, + Lumenier AXII 2 Diversity Antenna Bundle       getfpv,       FatShark, immersionRC, Lumenier       See OEM links for the datasheets                 Camera       RunCam Swift 2 (2.5mm Lens)       getfpv, Banggood       RunCam                         VTX       TBS Unify Pro HV               Team Black Sheep                   Antennas   Motors and ESC                  EMAX RS2205/2300Kv Motors and DYS ARIA BLHELI 35A ESCs.                  Component       Description       Shops       OEM Link       Comment                       Motor       EMAX RS2205/2300Kv RaceSpec Motor (CW)       getfpv, Banggood       EMAX       See OEM Link for the Datasheet                 ESC       DYS ARIA BLHELI_32BIT 35A ESC       getfpv, Banggood       dys                   Props      GetFPV: MASTER AIRSCREW BN SERIES - 5X4.5 PROP SET X4 - BLACK   Receiver   The following receiver from FrSky will be installed in the quad and should be used together with a FrSky transmitter.     GetFPV: FRSKY R-XSR 2.4GHZ 16CH ACCST MICRO RECEIVER W/ S-BUS &amp; CPPM   ","categories": ["fpv","quad"],
